=head1 NAME

SEPARATE_RECEPTORS - Divide data by receptor or polarization

=head1 DESCRIPTION

This recipe can be used to place the data for different receptors
or polarizations into different sets of files.  Once the data have
been separated in this way, they can be reduced to generate
receptor or polarization-specific products.

=head1 RECIPE PARAMETERS

=over 4

=item GROUP_BY

How to group data: either "receptor" to output each receptor
separately or "polarization" to group by polarization.  [receptor]

=item INCLUDE_ALL

Whether to include the original data in the output file listing
in order to subsequently also generate reduction products for all
receptors.  [0]

=back

